Commit:     Codex <codex@openai.com>
CommitDate: Mon Nov 16 05:06:43 2026 -0500

    nfc: nxp-nci: balance an optional reference clock across modes
    
    Enable the optional reference clock before raising controller GPIOs and
    release its vote after entering cold mode. Propagate lookup and enable
    errors, keep the core cold after failed open, and allow a subsequent retry.
    Repeated active transitions keep one clock vote.
    
    Nine synthetic clock/probe cases and three deliberate regression controls
    check ordering, retry, optional resources and error propagation. Ten
    closing-reset/removal cases also pass with normal leak checking and
    fail-fast address/undefined sanitizers. Physical NFC is not qualified.
    
    Port of Timothy Schmidt's original implementation f10c7ef55dfa.
    Author and timestamp are preserved. The port, changelog and qualification
    used OpenAI Codex assistance. Human review and DCO certification remain
    pending. No agent Signed-off-by tag is added.

